      "grid_message_index_0based": 5,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "わ、わかった落ち着け！\nなんでも力で解決しようとするのは良くないぞ。",
      "jp_sha256": "824e6f9519861c2f63f51978f52be930f4d5da25687c080ce8d15dad183b056d",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "아, 알았으니 진정해!\n무엇이든 힘으로 해결하려는 건 좋지 않아.",
      "message_index_0based": 5,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 38,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
